# Pokédex
# A whole note of requests, kept as a .http file. Send one with the button at the end of its
# line, or ⌘↵ anywhere in it; its response shows under it. The ### titles are the outline.
# #tour

@api = https://pokeapi.co/api/v2

### A Pokémon
# @name pokemon
GET {{api}}/pokemon/pikachu
Accept: application/json

### Its species, at an address the first response gives
# @name species
GET {{pokemon.response.body.$.species.url}}

### How it evolves, from the species
GET {{species.response.body.$.evolution_chain.url}}

### A page of them, the address going on over the lines below it
GET {{api}}/pokemon
    ?limit=5
    &offset=20

### One that isn't there: a 404
GET {{api}}/pokemon/missingno
